361 0 obj
<<
/Title (The experiment demonstrated how Zoho Creator's built-in analytics and Zia-assisted features convert plain book issue request records into decision-ready visuals with no custom charting code. The dashboard's tiles and charts give an instant overview of volume and distribution, colour formatting makes key columns easy to scan, and Kanban reports let library staff browse the same data as a visual board grouped by member type or book category. Zia supports this by suggesting charts and layouts, although some formatting still has to be configured manually in the report builder. Together these features show that low-code analytics in Zoho Creator is a natural extension of the structured forms and reports already built in earlier experiments.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 215 0 R
>>
endobj
