<<
/Title (Zoho Creator ships with analytics components that turn form records into visual summaries without any separate BI tool. A Dashboard page can combine summary tiles, pie and bar charts, and embedded reports in one view; individual reports can use colour formatting to highlight rows, cells or columns; and a Kanban report groups records into columns by a chosen field, giving a board-style view of status, category or member type. All of these read live data directly from the application's forms, so the visuals update automatically as records are added or changed.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 456 0 R
>>
endobj
